(ABSTRACT:) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Automated campus placement screening algorithms frequently inherit demographic selection disparities) Tj
0 -14 Td
(present in historical recruitment data. This research develops a rule-augmented machine learning framework) Tj
0 -14 Td
(incorporating Fairlearn mitigation algorithms to bound demographic parity disparities without compromising) Tj
0 -14 Td
(selection precision across an empirical cohort of 1,200 candidates and 50 recruiting firms.) Tj
